# Match expression as dict value — 3-arg [case [let] literal body] for literal arms,
# [case [let _] _ body] for wildcard fallback. input=42 matches neither 0 nor 1.
[input: 42
 classification: [match $input
   [case [let] 0 "zero"]
   [case [let] 1 "one"]
   [case [let _] _ "number"]]
 data: "other"]
=== out
Dict({"input": Int(42), "classification": String("number"), "data": String("other")})
